{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026OZ77X6wRzm1793226508.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在美國買賣的港股預託證券與本港收市比較，造價個別發展。</p><p></p><p>滙豐控股收市折合135.51元，比本港收市低9仙。工商銀行7.61元，高1仙。建設銀行9.92元，與本港收市價持平。友邦保險71.33元，高0.43元。港交所364.94元，低6仙。</p><p></p><p>騰訊控股385.42元，低2.18元。阿里巴巴99元，高0.1元。理想汽車44.68元，高4仙。金沙中國10.68元，高2仙。長和65.46元，低0.54元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:40:31.672783+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T22:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T11:38:14.610609+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T23:38:13.720038+00:00","content_hash":"ba14027e264298994e123b9555dd0841d1006fa6c17e480353e5c056876f1145","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:40:31.672783+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}